We need to keep scenes under 200 nodes. We'll create a scene with a green lawn (a large box or plane), four corner towers (cylinders with cones on top), crenellated walls built from boxes with DEF and USE (so we define a box for a wall segment and reuse it). A gatehouse with a dark doorway (maybe a box with a cutout? But we can simulate with a box for gatehouse and a black rectangle for doorway). A red flag on the tallest tower (maybe a thin box or a triangle). Use DEF/USE for repeated wall segments.

